OL,3,GNEWSAHow will extreme weather affect
OL,4,Aour food?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been a difficult year for
OL,7,Ffarmers in the West of England as a
OL,8,Fresult of the five heatwaves that have
OL,9,Fgripped the UK, scorching fields,
OL,10,Fplummeting crop yields, and leaving us
OL,11,Fin drought.
OL,13,FClimate scientists say extreme weather
OL,14,Fis becoming more likely, posing greater
OL,15,Fchallenges to food production from farm
OL,16,Fto fork.
OL,18,FWith a large farming industry in the
OL,19,Fregion, what does this mean for the
OL,20,Ffood on our plates?
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
