OL,3,GNEWSAHow will extreme weather affect
OL,4,Aour food?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think the consumers are going to
OL,7,Fnotice that it's going to cost more
OL,8,Fmoney for their food," says farmer Tom
OL,9,FCollins from Malmesbury, Wiltshire.
